{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34098","headline":"咏蟹 · 皮日休","name":"咏蟹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未游沧海早知名，有骨还从肉上生。\n莫道无心畏雷电，海龙王处也横行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}